[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2904781049","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106666#issuecomment-2904781049","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106666","id":2904781049,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tI3D5","user":{"login":"Koyper","id":33969780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTY5Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33969780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper","html_url":"https://github.com/Koyper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-23T15:15:00Z","updated_at":"2025-05-23T18:55:21Z","body":"For `FontFile` fonts (non-default fonts), the change below was needed for the correction to work because the fallback font name is \"Apple Color Emoji\". I tested this modification on IOS 18.4.1 with #77951 and it works correctly. Does it make sense to include `IOS_ENABLED` so this fix is applied when that PR is merged?\r\n```\r\n#if defined(MACOS_ENABLED) || defined(IOS_ENABLED)\r\n\t\tif (p_font_data->font_name == \".Apple Color Emoji UI\" || p_font_data->font_name == \"Apple Color Emoji\") {\r\n```\r\n\r\nAlso, the fix doesn't work when the fallback is set to \"Apple Color Emoji\" in the font file import settings, but it does work when no fallback is set (for non-MSDF fonts). The docs about font emoji say the fallback is required, but emojis work now without setting the fallback - is that correct?\r\n\r\nHere's the catch: If MSDF is enabled for a font, the emojis won't fallback unless \"Apple Color Emoji\" is set as a fallback, which then makes the offset correction stop working.\r\n\r\nDoes this mean there is another place where the system fallback is being rendered that this code needs to be applied to?\r\n\r\n`FontFile` _without_ \"Apple Color Emoji\" system font fallback applies baseline correction (with `allow_system_fallback` checked in the import settings):\r\n![Screenshot 2025-05-23 at 9 59 06 AM](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3caa5575-caf8-41b1-8b49-4020ee494181)\r\n\r\n`FontFile` _with_ \"Apple Color Emoji\" system font fallback. You can see the incorrect emoji offset in the preview:\r\n![Screenshot 2025-05-23 at 9 59 28 AM](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d5e24d90-41f0-4366-8c5e-ac433ef6f236)\r\n\r\nThis is with MSDF `enabled` and no system fallback set (but `allow_system_fallback` is still checked in the import settings):\r\n![Screenshot 2025-05-23 at 10 42 27 AM](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/292a7811-0f55-4e10-b7eb-81ee44884bf7)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2904781049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2905492710","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106666#issuecomment-2905492710","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106666","id":2905492710,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tLkzm","user":{"login":"Koyper","id":33969780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTY5Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33969780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper","html_url":"https://github.com/Koyper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-23T18:56:36Z","updated_at":"2025-05-23T19:03:59Z","body":"I just tested the prior suggestion on iOS 18.4.1 with #77951 and it looks like it's working correctly. Still has the issue described regarding system fallback.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2905492710/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2910228834","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106666#issuecomment-2910228834","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106666","id":2910228834,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tdpFi","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://ap